A","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"u537LRjJmHI4eqMARsP9ng","review_id":"daL5uKBTAnGXB4NOnZxqkg","date":"2016-03-14T19:45:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9410306811332703,"text_excerpt":"Dinner - omg.... maybe come here after not eating for the whole day! SO MUCH MEAT! And it was all so good. The lamb and the prime beef were my favorites. There is a salad bar which you can get salad, cheeses, smoked salmon, cured meats, pickles, etc. All was fresh and clean. I can't even remember what the sides were... I just kept eating the meat LOL. The caipirinha's (i got lime) were strong but refreshing. I love the brazillian steak house experience and Fogo de Chao doesn't disappoint. The wait staff are wonderful and very accommodating. HOWEVER the hostesses on the front counter are super RUDE. If you don't want to be at work get a DIFFERENT job. They have no idea whats going on. And ..."},{"business_id":"u537LRjJmHI4eqMARsP9ng","review_id":"1XtgPKbVkoJJthJOpMU5hw","date":"2017-04-27T00:22:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9397916793823242,"text_excerpt":"I dined here for my birthday celebration and I was not disappointed. The staff was very nice and professional. There was a lengthy wait before we were seated so we went to the bar for drinks first. Once our table was ready I was in heaven. The selection of meats was to die for. I tasted almost everything, but the lamb was my favorite. I guess I had the excuse to pig out since it was my birthday. LOL The market place buffet was full of fresh fruit, cheese, veggies, etc. I also really enjoyed the smoked salmon. I don't really get why there are the cards on the tables to let servers know when you're ready for more meats because even when it's flipped to red they still ask if you want any to ..."},{"business_id":"u537LRjJmHI4eqMARsP9ng","review_id":"RSZEBG5sW1ofRKAN2nf5hQ","date":"2021-10-19T19:00:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9322232007980347,"text_excerpt":"We had a nice birthday dinner here! It had been a while since I'd gone to Fogo and had never been to the one in NOLA. They have a lot of seating here and it was easy to accommodate our big party. The salad bar is really nice, with salmon, cheese, prosciutto, etc. The meat is the main show obviously and it comes around very frequently and all of it was cooked perfectly. I would go back again."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"u537LRjJmHI4eqMARsP9ng","photo_id":"r1da5BonHXP54GlXUwyHFw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/r1da5BonHXP54GlXUwyHFw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8950482606887817},{"business_id":"u537LRjJmHI4eqMARsP9ng","photo_id":"CiS8uM8SVNjSPn2HFt7bvg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CiS8uM8SVNjSPn2HFt7bvg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8880561590194702},{"business_id":"u537LRjJmHI4eqMARsP9ng","photo_id":"DLQ2pOL5m103U_LG4a_uFQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DLQ2pOL5m103U_LG4a_uFQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8638238906860352},{"business_id":"u537LRjJmHI4eqMARsP9ng","photo_id":"U1ScwmXaqpFEn9gj2B7mCA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/U1ScwmXaqpFEn9gj2B7mCA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8382751941680908},{"business_id":"u537LRjJmHI4eqMARsP9ng","photo_id":"MTayBFeddDg7wJ6k